# Allowlist: the image needs the lockfile, migrations, application code and entrypoint.
# Never send .env, the virtual environment, tests or caches to the build.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!native-runtime.json
!.python-version
!alembic.ini
!app/
!certs/
!migrations/
!docker-entrypoint.sh
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
